\ End-to-end exercise of a protocol-bounded generic dispatching to a
\ method on a satisfying type under runtime-image AOT. The registered
\ `step-count` method replays across the freeze->runtime boundary, so the
\ bounded call site resolves the method and returns 1, matching the
\ interpreter.

incrementable: protocol{ increment: } ;
step-count: virtual{ fixnum } ;

increment: generic ( x: incrementable -- y ) [ drop 0 >step-count ] ;
increment: method{ step-count } [ unmake-step-count 1 + >step-count ] ;

0 >step-count increment unmake-step-count .
